        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu May 11 2023 17:51:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Stryker is among the first companies to receive the Healthcare Industry Resiliency Collaborative (HIRC) Transparency Partner Badge. The HIRC Transparency Partner Badge recognizes Stryker’s commitment to drive collaboration and increase transparency in support of a more resilient healthcare supply chain.</p>\n<p>Stryker was selected as one of only eight healthcare suppliers to achieve this recognition, which aligns with the HIRC’s commitment to improving the resiliency of the healthcare supply chain. HIRC recognizes that both suppliers and providers have responsibility to patients and healthcare staff to improve the strength of the supply chain through partnership, collaboration, and transparency.</p>\n<p>Find more information about this recognition and the HIRC by <a href=\"https://hircstrong.com/\">visiting their website</a>.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 11 2023 17:52:16 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    }
